### Owner and tracker members can read and modify vacations and places.
### Ratings are nullable integers 0–10. Zero is distinct from an absent rating.
### Prices are nonnegative integers in the currency's smallest units.

### Search and filter vacations.
GET {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}?search=Costa&year=2025&order=rating&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Paginated place catalog: filters use the average of rated visits; unrated places sort last by rating.
GET {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/places/search?search=Costa&kind=Loď&area=Itálie&recommendation=FAVORITE&minRating=5&maxRating=10&order=rating&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a shared place (duplicate names are allowed).
POST {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/places
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Costa Toscana","kind":"Loď","country":"Itálie","recommendation":"NORMAL"}

### Create a vacation. Dates, year, price and ratings are optional.
POST {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Plavba Středomořím","status":"COMPLETED","type":"Plavba","focuses":["Wellness","Relax"],"year":2025,"approximate":true,"provider":"Costa","people":2,"totalMinor":200000,"currencyCode":"EUR","rating":9,"recommendation":"FAVORITE","ratings":{"Jídlo":8,"Wellness":9}}

### Detail includes visits, costs, and vacation photos.
GET {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/{{vacation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a visit to a shared place; its name and kind are stored as historical snapshots.
POST {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/{{vacation_id}}/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"placeId":"{{place_id}}","rating":8,"note":"Pěkná loď","ratings":{"Kajuta":9}}

### Add an informational expense. It is not added to the total.
POST {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/{{vacation_id}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Výlet","kind":"Výlety","amountMinor":1200,"currencyCode":"EUR"}

### An exact, non-approximate start date is needed for historical conversion.
### A future start uses the current rate as an estimate; for approximate dates use mode=current.
GET {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/{{vacation_id}}/conversion?target=CZK&mode=current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload a vacation photo; append ?visitId={{visit_id}} for a visit.
### JPEG, PNG, WebP, HEIC, GIF or AVIF; maximum 10 MB.
POST {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/{{vacation_id}}/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=vacation-photo

--vacation-photo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photo.jpg
--vacation-photo--

### Deleting a place preserves visit snapshots and photos; deleting a vacation removes its visits and photos.
DELETE {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/places/{{place_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry pending photo cleanup.
POST {{host}}/api/vacations/{{tracker_id}}/cleanup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
